History:
2010.02.11 GoldenDict updated (now based on Qt 4.7.0)
2010.02.11 NEW !!! parallel0.4 dictionary with examples and
pronunciation of words ! Just click "Pronounce word" button in the
toolbar while viewing an article from this dictionary and it'll be
played !
2010.07.10 NEW !!! Now we have the dictionary "la .uikipedias. (Eng-
Jbo)". This is the first attempt to convert the whole
jbo.wikipedia.org to a dictionary that can be viewed offline. No doubt
numerous bugs are present here. Pictures and math equations are not
imported.
2010.07.10 new dictionary "la .uikipedias. notci (Eng-Jbo)" that's
been converted from messages of Lojban Wikipedia (jbo.wikipedia.org).
Particularly useful for further improvement of those messages (as some
of them are not translated yet).
2010.26.09 NEW !!! "jbo-jbo_pixra_liste_loi_gismu" dictionary. Nice
mnemonic images. Useful for visual learning of the most frequent
gismu. Converted from http://jbo.wikipedia.org/wiki/pixra_liste_loi_gismu
2010.26.09 numerous fixes of bugs in dictionaries
2010.26.09 new icons for dictionaries created
2010.26.09 "jbo-eng_simplified_gismu" dictionary added
2010.13.09 some new dictionary icons added

